    {
      "id": "83a01484-233a-4d22-81ef-aee9b9147628",
      "title": "Escute e leia o comentario. Repare qual trecho explica por que a pessoa voltou.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 1,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "0ed60c60-426c-4d5b-9afa-b11b66d40161",
          "textContent": "<p>Escute e leia o comentario.</p><p><strong>Volví a la muestra por la manera en que las obras dialogaban entre sí.</strong></p><p>Em portugues: <strong>Voltei à mostra pela maneira como as obras dialogavam entre si.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/f909083a188844e0865a7cb49f658672_phase4-b01-volvi-a-la-muestra-por-la-manera-en-que-las-obras-dialogaban-entre-si.mp3?Expires=1794099853&Signature=hCuO~iHyWVQ6urHO-i38CvsIMRnn8swp0xnvtkk2Tv8PU~PA8Iau0hIn0LmdISdDEC-csTHCpZPFdbXKUmVVv76GdtCLZIP870RE56CyWg~bcKV7dd5U88iDrMpFsKzxZsAN1FUG3vwkKOD8Z~E6k5EF5pBJxLYdmzSPzdZ-GqnHjGP7p36o0OFVV6pDqUjttZu7hK2u2jLls3Hh6LnWo8QtRCXYjvZnlonFb5YSlLBMqsa9ODog~tNwADOW4YzdpF806gZ82jzk4z90WD7Nu-J7JaYh5cXIxRHhKUEVLEk2ULqEDqPD~phQmxdCwV9xUf2enYmki~5OBA9y2PPTbA__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
